        "response": {
          "bodySize": 4029,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 4029,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n    <head>\n        <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n        <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"INDEX,FOLLOW\" />\n\n<meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n<title>CLOSE-UP | Mulholland Drive</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Mulholland Drive tells a sordid tale of the industry of illusion and its boulevards of broken dreams – but for Lynch, these dreams fold into dreams within dreams within dreams. The noir cracks open and gives way to a multi-toned, terrifyingly beautiful hallucination that is as much a complex reflection on Hollywood as it is an endlessly transforming psychological puzzle.\" />\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"concrete5 - 5.4.2.1\" />\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\nvar CCM_DISPATCHER_FILENAME = '/index.php';\rvar CCM_CID = 4029;\rvar CCM_EDIT_MODE = false;\rvar CCM_ARRANGE_MODE = false;\rvar CCM_IMAGE_PATH = \"/concrete/images\";\nvar CCM_TOOLS_PATH = \"/tools/required\";\nvar CCM_REL = \"\";\n\n</script>\n\n\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/concrete/css/ccm.base.css?v=2da4b0ecd7a571f86d5ff112dbf545b9\" />\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/concrete/js/jquery.js?v=2da4b0ecd7a571f86d5ff112dbf545b9\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/concrete/js/ccm.base.js?v=2da4b0ecd7a571f86d5ff112dbf545b9\"></script>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/packages/mailchimp/blocks/mailchimp/view.css?v=2da4b0ecd7a571f86d5ff112dbf545b9\" />\n        <link href=\"/themes/close_up/css/closeup.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n        <link href=\"/themes/close_up/css/colorbox.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\n        <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/themes/close_up/images/favicon.ico\" />        \n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/themes/close_up/js/jquery.selectBox.min.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/themes/close_up/js/jquery.colorbox-min.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/themes/close_up/js/equalheights.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/themes/close_up/js/common.js\"></script>\n    </head>\n    <body>\n        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"header float_l\">\n                <a href=\"/\" class=\"float_l\">\n                    <a href=\"/\"><img border=\"0\" class=\"ccm-image-block\" alt=\"Close Up\" src=\"/files/1913/1590/2077/closeup_logo.jpg\" width=\"124\" height=\"34\" /></a>                </a>\n            </div>\n            <!-- header -->\n            <div class=\"nav_wrap float_l\">\n                <div class=\"nav_cont float_l\">\n                    <a href=\"/\"  >Home</a><a class=\"active\" href=\"/film_programmes/\"  >Film Programmes</a><a href=\"/library/\"  >Library</a><a href=\"/membership/\"  >Membership</a><a href=\"/venue-hire/\"  >Venue Hire</a><a href=\"/vertigo_magazine/issue-31-winter-2012-in-conversation/\"  >Vertigo Magazine</a><a href=\"/archives/\"  >Archive</a>                </div><!-- nav_cont -->\n                <div class=\"nav_search float_r\">\n                    <form id=\"advsearchform\" action=\"/search_results/\" method=\"get\">\n    \n    <input name=\"query\" type=\"text\" style=\"width:146px;\" class=\"input_text float_l\" value=\"Search...\" onkeydown=\"this.value=='Search...'?this.value='':''\" onclick=\"this.value=='Search...'?this.value='':''\" onblur=\"this.value==''?this.value='Search...':''\"/>\n        <input name=\"search_paths[]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\" />\n            \n  \t\t\t\t\n  </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n<div id=\"fb-root\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"inner_wrap float_l\">\n    <div class=\"inner_block_5\">          \n        <div class=\"float_l\">\n            <div class=\"inner_block_2_l\" id=\"film_program_support\">                \n                <div class='border'>\n<h1>15 - 29 March 2025: Mulholland Drive</h1>\n</div>\n<!--    <img src=''/>-->\n<!--    <br/>-->\n<!--    <br/>-->\n    <p><p><img src=\"/download_file/view_inline/8490/\" alt=\"mulholland-drive-david-lynch-2.jpg\" width=\"546\" height=\"364\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong>Mulholland Drive<br /></strong>David Lynch, 2001, 147 min</p>\r\n<p>\"Like Billy Wilder&rsquo;s film named after another iconic Hollywood street, <em>Mulholland Drive </em>tells a sordid tale of the industry of illusion and its boulevards of broken dreams &ndash; but for Lynch, these dreams fold into dreams within dreams within dreams. (&hellip;) The noir cracks open and gives way to a multi-toned, terrifyingly beautiful hallucination that is as much a complex reflection on Hollywood as it is an endlessly transforming psychological puzzle. Cinematic archetypes &ndash; including all versions of the female presented or rejected by Hollywood &ndash; double, reflect and regenerate into uncanny metaphors in Lynch&rsquo;s subconscious minefield where the fluid layers of identity, nostalgia, desire, deception and projection could be in the minds of the characters, the audience, or a complete fabrication by dark, unknown forces behind the scenes&hellip; or well beyond.\" &ndash; Harvard Film Archive</p>\r\n<hr />\r\n<p>Screening as part of our <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.closeupfilmcentre.com/film_programmes/2025/david-lynch-a-ghost-dreaming-of-a-ghost/\">tribute to David Lynch</a></span></p></p>                 <!-- <div class=\"social_bottom\"> \n                    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"//s7.addthis.com/js/300/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-53a2c6af5037a6f1\"></script>\n                    <div class=\"addthis_native_toolbox\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n                </div> -->\n                <div class=\"social_bottom\">\n                    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"//s7.addthis.com/js/300/addthis_widget.js#pubid=ra-53a2c6af5037a6f1\"></script>\n                    <div>\n                    <div>\n                        <a class=\"addthis-btn addthis_button_facebook\"><img src=\"/files/cache/88d4fdd377c9f5c3e1627a9fae5e1462.png\" alt=\"new_facebook.png\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"> Share</a>\n                        <a class=\"addthis-btn addthis_button_twitter\"><img src=\"/files/cache/70f7402860d2d39c06fd82db91fd10fc.png\" alt=\"nem_twitter.png\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"> Tweet</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>    <!-- inner_block_2_l -->  \n\n                <div class=\"booking_calender\">\n        <h1>Calendar</h1>\n                <table width=\"100%\" id=\"addform\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"border_b_1\"><h2>Title</h2></td>\n                <td class=\"border_b_1\"><h2>Date</h2></td>\n                <td class=\"border_b_1\"><h2>Time</h2></td>\n                <td class=\"border_b_1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><h2>Book</h2></td>\n            </tr>\n                            <tr id=\"row\">\n                    <td class=\"border_b_1\">Mulholland Drive</td>\n                    <td class=\"border_b_1\">Saturday 15.03.25</td>\n                    <td class=\"border_b_1\">8:00 pm</td>\n                    <td width=\"50\" class=\"border_b_1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\n                                                    <a href=\"https://www.ticketsource.co.uk/close-up-cinema/e-zobjam\" class=\"input_btn\" target=\"_blank\">Book</a>\n                                            </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr id=\"row\">\n                    <td class=\"border_b_1\">Mulholland Drive</td>\n                    <td class=\"border_b_1\">Thursday 27.03.25</td>\n                    <td class=\"border_b_1\">8:15 pm</td>\n                    <td width=\"50\" class=\"border_b_1\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\n                                                    <a href=\"https://www.ticketsource.co.uk/close-up-cinema/e-zobjam\" class=\"input_btn\" target=\"_blank\">Book</a>\n                                            </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr id=\"row\">\n                    <td class=\"\">Mulholland Drive</td>\n                    <td class=\"\">Saturday 29.03.25</td>\n                    <td class=\"\">8:00 pm</td>\n                    <td width=\"50\" class=\"\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\n                                                    <a href=\"https://www.ticketsource.co.uk/close-up-cinema/e-zobjam\" class=\"input_btn\" target=\"_blank\">Book</a>\n                                            </td>\n                </tr>\n                        </table>\n    </div>\n        </div>       <!-- inner_block_2 -->\n        <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\n    </div>  <!-- inner_block_4 -->\n</div><!-- inner_wrap -->\n\t<div class=\"footer float_l\">\n    \t<div class=\"footer_cont_1 float_l\">\n        \t<p>Close-Up Film Centre<br />97 Sclater Street<br /> London E1 6HR<br />+44 (0)20 3784 7970<br />info@closeupfilmcentre.com<br />Open Monday to Sunday: 12:00 - 12:00</p>\r\n<div id=\"skype_c2c_menu_container\" class=\"skype_c2c_menu_container notranslate\" style=\"display: none;\" onmouseover=\"SkypeClick2Call.MenuInjectionHandler.showMenu(this, event)\" onmouseout=\"SkypeClick2Call.MenuInjectionHandler.hideMenu(this, event)\">\r\n<div class=\"skype_c2c_menu_click2call\"><a id=\"skype_c2c_menu_click2call_action\" class=\"skype_c2c_menu_click2call_action\" target=\"_self\">Call</a></div>\r\n<div class=\"skype_c2c_menu_click2sms\"><a id=\"skype_c2c_menu_click2sms_action\" class=\"skype_c2c_menu_click2sms_ac